   "source": [
    "# SubgraphGNN — Colab Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs SubgraphGNN training and the autonomous autoresearch loop on a free T4 GPU.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before running:** Make sure your TrimNN data is in Google Drive at:\n",
    "```\n",
    "My Drive/TrimNN/intestinalOutputs/\n",
    "My Drive/TrimNN/demo_data/\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1 — Mount Google Drive"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 2 — Clone repo and link data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "!git clone https://github.com/lotion-3/SubgraphGNN.git /content/SubgraphGNN\n",
    "\n",
    "# Symlink so ../TrimNN/intestinalOutputs relative paths work from /content/SubgraphGNN/\n",
    "if not os.path.exists('/content/TrimNN'):\n",
    "    os.symlink('/content/drive/MyDrive/TrimNN', '/content/TrimNN')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('intestinalOutputs:', os.path.isdir('/content/TrimNN/intestinalOutputs'))\n",
    "print('demo_data:', os.path.isdir('/content/TrimNN/demo_data'))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 3 — Install dependencies and verify GPU"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install igraph -q\n",
    "\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "print('PyTorch:', torch.__version__)\n",
    "print('GPU:', torch.cuda.get_device_name(0) if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'NOT AVAILABLE — check Runtime > Change runtime type')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 4 — Add your Anthropic API key\n",
    "\n",
    "Needed only for the autoresearch loop (Step 6). Not needed for a single training run (Step 5).\n",
    "\n",
    "In the left sidebar, click the **key icon (Secrets)** → add a secret named `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` with your key."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Load the API key from Colab Secrets into the environment\n",
    "from google.colab import userdata\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.environ['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY'] = userdata.get('ANTHROPIC_API_KEY')\n",
    "print('API key loaded:', len(os.environ['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']) > 0)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 5 — Single training run (optional, skip if using autoresearch loop)\n",
    "\n",
    "Trains for 5 minutes on T4, saves model to `trimnn_model.pt`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd /content/SubgraphGNN\n",
    "!python3 train_trimnn.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 6 — Autoresearch loop\n",
    "\n",
    "Claude autonomously proposes experiments, runs them, keeps improvements, reverts regressions.\n",
    "Each iteration: ~5 min training + ~1 min Claude API = ~6 min/experiment → ~100 experiments per 12h session.\n",
    "\n",
    "Stop at any time with the stop button — the last good result is always preserved in git."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd /content/SubgraphGNN\n",
    "!pip install anthropic -q\n",
    "!python3 research_loop.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 7 — Save results to Drive\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this after the loop (or periodically). Colab sessions are temporary — Drive is permanent."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import shutil, os\n",
    "save_dir = '/content/drive/MyDrive/SubgraphGNN_results'\n",
    "os.makedirs(save_dir, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "shutil.copy('/content/SubgraphGNN/trimnn_model.pt', save_dir)\n",
    "shutil.copy('/content/SubgraphGNN/results.tsv', save_dir)\n",
    "print('Saved to Drive:', save_dir)"
   ]
  }
 ]
}"
